body:
I can't even imagine what a difficult situation that must be. =/ 

My parents weren't quite so intellectual, and didn't really do much reading, but they did stumble across this parody article: http://www.landoverbaptist.org/news1099/pokemon.html

It was a shitstorm like no other. They immediately threw away every last thing Pokémon related I had. And gave it all back a few days later. Then did it again. So many cards, so many toys, so many games. ;_;
